 100:.\src\app/psink.c ****     {
 101:.\src\app/psink.c ****         /* If dead battery case then delaying cfet off so that terminations
 102:.\src\app/psink.c ****          * removed can be seen by peer otherwise if fet is off immdiately then
 103:.\src\app/psink.c ****          * chip loose power and in dead battery state Rd is still seen by peer
